#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Započinjanje"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &kturtle; you will see something like this: <screenshot> "
"<screeninfo>Here is a screenshot of &kturtle; when you start it for the "
"first time</screeninfo> <mediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"mainwindow.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>&kturtle; on a fresh start</phrase> </textobject> </mediaobject> </"
"screenshot> In this Getting Started guide we assume that the language of the "
"&turtlescript; commands is English. You can change this language with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Script Language</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>. Be aware that the language you set here for "
"&kturtle; is the one you use to type the &turtlescript; commands, not the "
"language used by &kde; on your computer and used to display the &kturtle; "
"interface and menus."
msgstr ""
"Kada otvorite &kturtle; vidjet će te nešto kao ovo: <screenshot> "
"<screeninfo>Ove slike zaslona &kturtle; kada ga pokrenete prvi put</"
"screeninfo> <mediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"mainwindow.png"
"\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>&kturtle; pri novom "
"pokretanju</phrase> </textobject> </mediaobject> </screenshot> U ovom "
"Započinjanju vodić će pretpostaviti da je jezik vaših &turtlescript; komandi "
"Engleski. Možete promjeniti jezik sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Spisak Jezika</guisubmenu></menuchoice>. Trebate biti "
"svjesni da jezik koji odaberete sada za &kturtle; je onaj koji će te "
"koristiti za kucanje &turtlescript; komandi, a ne jezik koji koristi &kde; "
"na vašem kompjuteru i koristi za prikaz &kturtle; izgleda i menija."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "First steps with &turtlescript;: meet the Turtle!"
msgstr "Prvi koraci sa &turtlescript;: upoznajte Kornjaču!"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You must have noticed the turtle in the middle of the canvas: you are just "
"about to learn how to control it using commands in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Morali ste primjetiti kornjaču na sredini platna: sada će te naučiti da "
"upravljate njome pomoću uređivačkih komandi."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Turtle Moves"
msgstr "Kretanje Kornjače"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let us start by getting the turtle moving. Our turtle can do 3 types of "
"moves, (1) it can move forwards and backwards, (2) it can turn left and "
"right and (3) it can go (jump) directly to a position on the screen. Try "
"this for example:"
msgstr ""
"Započnimo pokretanjem kornjače. Naša kornjača može da se kreće na 3 načina, "
"(1) može da se kreće naprijed i nazad, (2) može da se kreće lijevo i desno i "
"(3) može ići (skočiti) direktno na poziciju na ekranu. Npr. probajte ovo:"

#. Tag: screen
#: getting-started.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"forward 100\n"
"turnleft 90"
msgstr ""
"naprijed 100\n"
"lijelo 90"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type or copy-paste the code to the editor and execute it (using <link "
"linkend=\"run-execute\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Run</guimenu><guimenuitem>Run</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice></link>) to see the result."
msgstr ""
"Opkucajte ili kopirajte i zalijepite kod u uređivač i izvršite ga (koristeći "
"<link linkend=\"run-execute\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Pokreni</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Pokreni</guimenuitem></menuchoice></link>) da bi ste "
"vidjeli rezultate."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you typed and executed the commands like above in the editor you might "
"have noticed one or more of the following things:"
msgstr ""
"Kada ste otkucali i izvršili naredbe u uređivaču kao u prethodnom slučaju "
"možda ste primijetili par stvari:"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That &mdash; after executing the commands &mdash; the turtle moves up, draws "
"a line, and then turns a quarter turn to the left. This because you have "
"used the <link linkend=\"forward\"><userinput>forward</userinput></link> and "
"the <link linkend=\"turnleft\"><userinput>turnleft</userinput></link> "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"&mdash; nakon izvršavanja komandi &mdash; kornjača se kreće ka gore, nacrta "
"liniju te se okrene za 90 stepeni lijevo. Ovo se desilo jer ste koristili "
"<link linkend=\"forward\"><userinput>naprijed</userinput></link> i <link "
"linkend=\"turnleft\"><userinput>lijevo</userinput></link> komande."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That the color of the code changed while you where typing it: this feature "
"is called <emphasis>intuitive highlighting</emphasis> &mdash; different "
"types of commands are highlighted differently. This makes reading large "
"blocks of code more easy."
msgstr ""
"Boja kod se je promjenila dok ste kucali: ovo mogućnost se naziva "
"<emphasis>intuitivno naglašavanje</emphasis> &mdash; različiti tipovi "
"komandi se naglašeni drugačije. Ovo čini čitanje većih dijelova koda lakšim."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "That the turtle draws a thin black line."
msgstr "Kornjača crta tanku crnu liniju."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Maybe you got an error message. This could simply mean two things: you could "
"have made a mistake while copying the commands, or you should still set the "
"correct language for the &turtlescript; commands (you can do that by "
"choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guisubmenu>Script Language</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>)."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je da ste dobili poruku o greši. Ovo može da znači dvije stvari: "
"Možda ste pogriješili pri kopiranju komandi, ili još uvijek trebati podesiti "
"jezik za &turtlescript; komande (to možete učiniti koristeći "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guisubmenu>Jezik Skripte</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>)."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will likely understand that <userinput>forward 100</userinput> "
"instructed the turtle to move forward leaving a line, and that "
"<userinput>turnleft 90</userinput> instructed the turtle to turn 90 "
"<glossterm linkend=\"degrees\">degrees</glossterm> to the left."
msgstr ""
"Vi ćete vjerojatno shvatiti da je <userinput> naprijed 100 </userinput> "
"uputio kornjaču da se krene naprijed crtajući liniju, a da je <userinput> "
"lijevo 90 </userinput> uputio kornjaču da se okrene 90 <glossterm linkend="
"\"degrees\"> stepeni </glossterm> na lijevo."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please see the following links to the reference manual for a complete "
"explanation of the new commands: <link linkend=\"forward"
"\"><userinput>forward</userinput></link>, <link linkend=\"backward"
"\"><userinput>backward</userinput></link>, <link linkend=\"turnleft"
"\"><userinput>turnleft</userinput></link>, and <link linkend=\"turnright"
"\"><userinput>turnright</userinput></link>."
msgstr ""
"Molimo pogledajte slijedeće linkove za referentni priručnik za cjelovito "
"objašnjenje novih komandi <link linkend=\"forward\"><userinput>naprijed</"
"userinput></link>, <link linkend=\"backward\"><userinput>nazad</userinput></"
"link>, <link linkend=\"turnleft\"><userinput>lijevo</userinput></link>, and "
"<link linkend=\"turnright\"><userinput>desno</userinput></link>."

#. Tag: title
#: getting-started.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "More examples"
msgstr "Više primjera"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "The first example was very simple, so let us go on!"
msgstr "Prvi primjer je vio jednostavan, pa krenimo dalje!"

#. Tag: screen
#: getting-started.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"reset\n"
"\n"
"canvassize 200,200\n"
"canvascolor 0,0,0\n"
"pencolor 255,0,0\n"
"penwidth 5\n"
"\n"
"go 20,20\n"
"direction 135\n"
"\n"
"forward 200\n"
"turnleft 135\n"
"forward 100\n"
"turnleft 135\n"
"forward 141\n"
"turnleft 135\n"
"forward 100\n"
"turnleft 45\n"
"\n"
"go 40,100"
msgstr ""
"ponovno postavi\n"
"\n"
"veličina platna 200,200\n"
"boja platna 0,0,0\n"
"boja olovke 255,0,0\n"
"širina olovke 5\n"
"\n"
"idi 20,20\n"
"pravac 135\n"
"\n"
"naprijed 200\n"
"lijevo 135\n"
"naprijed 100\n"
"lijevot 135\n"
"naprijed 141\n"
"lijevo 135\n"
"naprijed 100\n"
"ijevo 45\n"
"\n"
"go 40,100"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Again you can type or copy-paste the code to the editor or open the "
"<filename>arrow</filename> example in the <guimenu>Examples</guimenu> menu "
"and execute it (using <link linkend=\"run-execute"
"\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Run</guimenu><guimenuitem>Run</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice></link>) to see the result. In the next examples you are expected "
"to know the drill."
msgstr ""
"Ponovo možete otkucati ili kopirati i zalijepiti kod u uređivač ili otvoriti "
"<filename>strelica</filename> primjer u <guimenu>Primjeri</guimenu> "
"izborniku i izvršiti ga (koristeći <link linkend=\"run-execute"
"\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Pokreni</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pokreni</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice></link>) da bi ste vidjeli rezultate. U narednom primjeru očekuje "
"se da ste upoznati sa postupkom."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might have noticed that this second example uses a lot more code. You "
"have also seen a couple of new commands. Here a short explanation of all the "
"new commands:"
msgstr ""
"Možda ste primijetili da drugi primjer uzima mnogo više koda. Također ste "
"vidjeli i par novih komandi. Ovdje je dato kratko objašnjenje svih novih "
"komandi:"

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After a <userinput>reset</userinput> command everything is like is was when "
"you had just started &kturtle;."
msgstr ""
"Poslije <userinput>vrati na početak</userinput> kamande sve je kao kad ste "
"tek počeli raditi u &kturtle;."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>canvassize 200,200</userinput> sets the canvas width and height "
"to 200 <glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">pixels</glossterm>. The width and the "
"height are equal, so the canvas will be a square."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>veličinaplatna 200,200</userinput> podešava dužinu i visinu "
"platna na 200 <glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">piksela</glossterm>. Dužina i "
"visina su jednaka tak da će platno biti kvadrat."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>canvascolor 0,0,0</userinput> makes the canvas black. "
"<userinput>0,0,0</userinput> is a <glossterm linkend=\"rgb\">RGB-"
"combination</glossterm> where all values are set to <userinput>0</"
"userinput>, which results in black."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>Bojaplatna 0,0,0</userinput> pretvara platno u crno. "
"<userinput>0,0,0</userinput> je <glossterm linkend=\"rgb\">RGB-kombinacija</"
"glossterm> gdje su sve vrijednosti podešene na <userinput>0</userinput>, što "
"rezultira crnom bojom."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>pencolor 255,0,0</userinput> sets the color of the pen to red. "
"<userinput>255,0,0</userinput> is a <glossterm linkend=\"rgb\">RGB-"
"combination</glossterm> where only the red value is set to <userinput>255</"
"userinput> (fully on) while the others (green and blue) are set to "
"<userinput>0</userinput> (fully off). This results in a bright shade of red."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>bojaolovke 255,0,0</userinput> podešava boju olovke na crvenu. "
"<userinput>255,0,0</userinput> je <glossterm linkend=\"rgb\">RGB-"
"kombinacija</glossterm> gdje je samo crvena vrijednost podešena na "
"<userinput>255</userinput> (potpuno) dok su druge (zelena i plava) podešene "
"na <userinput>0</userinput> (potuno). Ovo rezultira jarkom crvenom bojom."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not understand the color values, be sure to read the glossary on "
"<glossterm linkend=\"rgb\">RGB-combination</glossterm>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne razumijete vrijednosti boja, obavezno pročitajte pojmovnik o "
"<glossterm linkend=\"rgb\">RGB-kombinacija</glossterm>."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>penwidth 5</userinput> sets the width (the size) of the pen to "
"<userinput>5</userinput> <glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">pixels</glossterm>. "
"From now on every line the turtle draw will have a thickness of "
"<userinput>5</userinput>, until we change the <userinput>penwidth</"
"userinput> to something else."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>debljina olovke 5</userinput> podesite debljinu (veličinu) olovke "
"<userinput>5</userinput> <glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">pikseli</glossterm>. "
"Od sada će svaka linija koju crta kornjača će biti debljine <userinput>5</"
"userinput>, sve dok ne  promjenimo <userinput>debljina olovke</userinput> na "
"neku drugu."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>go 20,20</userinput> commands the turtle to go to a certain place "
"on the canvas. Counted from the upper left corner, this place is 20 "
"<glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">pixels</glossterm> across from the left, and "
"20 <glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">pixels</glossterm> down from the top of the "
"canvas. Note that using the <userinput>go</userinput> command the turtle "
"will not draw a line."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>idi 20,20</userinput> nalažu kornjači da ide do određenog mjesta "
"na platnu. Brojeći od gornjeg lijevog ugla, ovo mjesto se nalazi na 20 "
"<glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">piksela</glossterm> sa lijeve strane, i 20 "
"<glossterm linkend=\"pixels\">piksela</glossterm> od vrha platna. Primjetite "
"da korištenjem  <userinput>idi</userinput> komande kornjača neće crtati "
"liniju."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>direction 135</userinput> set the turtle's direction. The "
"<userinput>turnleft</userinput> and <userinput>turnright</userinput> "
"commands change the turtle's angle starting from its current direction. The "
"<userinput>direction</userinput> command changes the turtle's angle from "
"zero, and thus is not relative to the turtle previous direction."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>smjer 135</userinput> podešava kornjačin smjer. "
"<userinput>lijevo</userinput> i <userinput>desno</userinput> komande "
"mjenjaju ugao od trenutnog polažaja kornjače. <userinput>smjer</"
"userinput>komande mjenjaju kornjačin ugao od nule, i to neovisno od "
"kornjačinog trenutnog položaja."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After the <userinput>direction</userinput> command a lot of "
"<userinput>forward</userinput> and <userinput>turnleft</userinput> commands "
"follow. These command do the actual drawing."
msgstr ""
"Poslije <userinput>smjer</userinput>komade puno <userinput>naprijed</"
"userinput> i <userinput>lijevo</userinput> komandi slijede. Ove komade "
"ustvari crtaju."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At last another <userinput>go</userinput> command is used to move the turtle "
"aside."
msgstr ""
"Na kraju još jedna <userinput>idi</userinput> komanda se koristi za "
"sklanjanje kornjače."

#. Tag: para
#: getting-started.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure you follow the links to the reference. The reference explains each "
"command more thoroughly."
msgstr ""
"Potrudite se da slijedite linkove za reference. One objašnjavaju svaku "
"komandu temeljito."
